dsh-yamada-night-shift / 山田的夜班
===================================

The compatibility scaffold and plugin lifecycle were adapted from
`Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale/maid-atelier`:

https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale

Generated visual assets were created for this skin with OpenAI image
generation using user-supplied Yamada visual references. No maid artwork from
the upstream project is included in the runtime bundle.

